{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつきっ(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ぴーすぴーすぴーすin秋田／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/05/6989774/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけでどうも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田にいっていました若月です。こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田はビックリするほど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のどかで素敵な場所でした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田の皆さんお世話になりました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーディションについての記事に少し面白いものを見つけたので捕捉(σ*´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『\"ありがとう\"私が大好きな言葉です。私は沢山の人にこの言葉を伝えたい。私が今夢を追うことができているのは周りの人の支えや応援があるからです。幸せな人生ですね。私の将来の夢は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かの人生に少しでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い影響として関わることです。乃木坂46に絶対になって私の声やダンスや笑顔で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の夢を沢山の人に与えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"ありがとう\"と言われる人間になりたいと思っています。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの、私が最終審査で言った自己アピールの内容です(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと言えるようにと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全文メモってありました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この頃から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱っ苦しかったんですね。私。(笑)確実にこれは演説で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自己アピールではない(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ(・д・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで若月ブログ始まりますよと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井が隣で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"膝が痛いっていってるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんが鏡に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"向かって変顔してたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッションチェックで最悪だったリュックはお母さんが買ってくれて、今日の服はアベイルだよと教えてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"化粧水を前髪にかけて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また乾かしてるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒がかずみさんの靴下に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"醤油をこぼしたよ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんが勉強してたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間違えて男性のお手洗いの入り口に行きかけて焦ったらしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、目についたものを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書いてみた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが、今の楽屋裏(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、ばかつきぃ(σ*´∀｀)"}],"source":"archive"}